<title>USA: Pacific Telesis ups div to $0.3275/shr.</title>
<headline>Pacific Telesis ups div to $0.3275/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Telesis Group Inc said its board of directors approved a four percent increase in the corporation's quarterly dividend, raising the payment to $0.3275 per share from $0.3150, payable May 1 to shareowners of record on March 28.</p>
</text>
